item+ function src/phext.rs :: phokenize :: pub fn phokenize(input: &str) -> Vec<PositionedScroll> { :: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- @fn phokenize  Transforms a packed phext buffer into a phext token (phoken) stream  One pass over the bytes. Each step matches a call to `next_scroll`: skip leading breaks, take a run of text, then consume the break that ends it. Earlier versions called `next_scroll` in a loop, which copied the rest of the document for every scroll and made this quadratic in the document size. ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- :: doc comment :: 858 :: 1
