item+ function src/phext.rs :: verify_commit :: pub fn verify_commit(input: &str, entries: &[Coordinate], commit: Coordinate) -> bool { :: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- @fn verify_commit  true when the scroll at `commit` is a commit marker whose count matches `entries` and whose checksum matches the entries' current contents, fetched in order. Any missing, altered, or torn entry — or a missing marker — yields false: the batch did not commit. ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- :: doc comment :: 2035 :: 1
