item+ const src/epoch.rs :: AGES_PER_EPOCH :: pub const AGES_PER_EPOCH: u64 = 1 << AGE_BITS; :: The number of Sentron Ages in one Exocortical Epoch: 2^42 = 4,398,046,511,104. The canonical reference clock is AGES_PER_EPOCH / 420 ≈ 10.4715 GHz, so one Sentron Age is ≈ 95.5 picoseconds. :: doc comment :: 71 :: 1
