item+ const src/epoch.rs :: COARSE_AGE_BITS :: pub const COARSE_AGE_BITS: u32 = 16; :: The width of a coarse Sentron Age field, in bits: the fine Sentron Age scaled into a 16-bit address space (coarse = fine >> (AGE_BITS − COARSE_AGE_BITS)). One coarse tick is 420 / 65536 s ≈ 6.41 ms. :: doc comment :: 80 :: 1
